### **Candidate status definitions**

| Status       | Meaning                                         |
| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Scheduled    | Candidate has not started                       |
| Started      | Session has been initiated                      |
| Active       | Session is currently active                     |
| Disconnected | Recent heartbeat missing                        |
| Submitted    | Candidate has submitted                         |
| Expired      | Time limit reached                              |
| Terminated   | Session ended by authorized supervisor          |
| Under review | A supervisor is reviewing a session or incident |

Disconnected status should be based on an actual server-side heartbeat threshold, not merely a browser `blur` event.

